\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924140/extras/be7001bec386c4e76f653c38bcfd286f.poster.avif?t=1766937098\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924140/extras/be7001bec386c4e76f653c38bcfd286f.webm?t=1766937098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924140/extras/be7001bec386c4e76f653c38bcfd286f.mp4?t=1766937098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful. If you lose, your allies will be captured by the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Don't worry too much, if you want, you can sacrifice yourself to prevent that from happening.)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginning of Everything","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1924140/4e590ea25a4d1a3c6a2a0bd655a59e02da0bfe15.jpg"},{"name":"So Easy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1924140/76f7571ba8a333ee1b052b4b68710abcd3db70ca.jpg"},{"name":"The New Normal?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1924140/87887708eab9e2be54b633aca98bd139e603e116.jpg"},{"name":"Do You Know Chernobyl?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1924140/c7e5b6450bde89feb47d3ecdf26ceb14ebf637d4.jpg"},{"name":"Pheromone Cloud","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1924140/b727b580cb2645b231ba52bac09d87cad1f3fcfd.jpg"},{"name":"More Pheromone Clouds!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1924140/ed45e3b72dbc12472a3cd7ad23e13e9d168ad3fe.jpg"},{"name":"Armor Break!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1924140/1832d39c8cd988bab41df9476c51eff5ecbe9461.